From d6c6e7b7dafa30039f0cdb419fa92cbc8e917363 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qopalboker <qopalboker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 05:00:51 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] LIFECYCLE-003: Replace hard-delete cleanup with audit-safe
 archival

Soft-delete contests via archived_at, copy related rows to archive
tables, retain 7 years, and exclude archived contests from hot-path
listings. Postgres E2E archival remains a tracked verification gap.
